#: kstart.cpp:172
msgid "Command to execute."
msgstr "Naredba koju treba izvršiti."

#: kstart.cpp:174
msgid ""
"A regular expression matching the window title.\n"
"If you do not specify one, then the very first window\n"
"to appear will be taken. Not recommended!"
msgstr ""
"Ispravan izraz koji odgovara naslovu prozora.\n"
"Ako ne navedete izraz, onda će prvi prikazani prozor biti uzet. Nije "
"preporučljivo!"

#: kstart.cpp:177
msgid "Desktop where to make the window appear. "
msgstr "Desktop na kojoj se prozor treba pojaviti."

#: kstart.cpp:178
msgid ""
"Make the window appear on the desktop that was active\n"
"when starting the application. "
msgstr ""
"Neka se prozor pojavi na desktopu koji je bio ativan\n"
"kada je porenut program."

#: kstart.cpp:179
msgid "Make the window appear on all desktops"
msgstr "Neka se prozor pojavi na svim desktopima."

#: kstart.cpp:180
msgid "Iconify the window"
msgstr "Pretvori prozor u ikonu"

#: kstart.cpp:181
msgid "Maximize the window"
msgstr "Povećaj prozor"

#: kstart.cpp:182
msgid ""
"The window type: Normal, Desktop, Dock, Tool, \n"
"Menu, Dialog or Override"
msgstr ""
"Vrste prozora: Normalan, Desktop, Dok, Alat, \n"
"Meni, Dijalog ili Zaobiđi"

#: kstart.cpp:183
msgid ""
"Jump to the window even if it is started on a \n"
"different virtual desktop"
msgstr ""
"Odi na prozor i u slučaju da se nalazi na nekom \n"
"drugom virtualnom desktopu."

#: kstart.cpp:185
msgid "Make the window always stay on top of any other window"
msgstr "Neka je prozor uvijek iznad bilo kojeg drugog prozora"

#: kstart.cpp:186
msgid "The window does not get an entry in the taskbar"
msgstr "Prozor se neće pojaviti na traci sa zadacima"

#: kstart.cpp:187
msgid "The window does not get an entry on the pager"
msgstr "Prozor se neće pojaviti na pageru"

#: kstart.cpp:188
msgid "The window is sent to the system tray in Kicker."
msgstr ""

#: kstart.cpp:195
msgid "KStart"
msgstr "KStart"

#: kstart.cpp:196
msgid ""
"Utility to launch applications with special window properties \n"
"such as iconified, maximized, a certain virtual desktop, a special "
"decoration\n"
"and so on."
msgstr ""
"Alat za pokretanje programa čiji prozori imaju posebna\n"
"svojstva, kao npr. pretvoreni u ikone, maksimalno povećani, poseban\n"
"desktop, poseban ukras i slično."

#: kstart.cpp:216
msgid "No command specified"
msgstr "Bez određene naredbe"

